      "message": "This keeps the previous behavior which was decrease `num_active` and remove the call (CRAS) from the `call_list`.\nCurrently, if `num_active` is not 0 at the end of `hangup_call_impl` the audio is not disconnected.",
      "parentUuid": "1f25e490_f7032f56",
